        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Savage, are you busy...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Huh? Amiya, you're early here today."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "There's no goods that need delivering today, and I've got nothing too urgent to deal with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "What's the matter, Amiya? Nothing on your plate today either?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Today, the Doctor, Kal'tsit, and Theresa went outside, and they wanted me to stay by myself in my room for now... and then they'd all come back at dinner."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But I don't know what I should even do, alone in my room..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Hmmm\u2014hm, so you decided to sneak out and look for me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Hehe..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "*Sigh*. That's just how adults are, always tormented by work they can't finish. Not to mention those three make everyone wonder how much of a tireless 'workaholic' someone can be..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Does everyone become like that after they grow up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Not really... some people are forced to be, but there are actual people who believe, from the bottom of their hearts, how diving all the way into work enriches their life."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "What kind are you, then, Miss Savage?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Me, eh...? When I'm working, I do my part properly until I'm done. I guess I decently like it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "But I can relax right now, so of course it'd be even more fun to be with you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "That's right, Amiya, why don't we take advantage of today to try and cook something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Cook?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "You can learn to make your most favorite Rim Billiton foods, like... carrot pie! Don't you wanna see what it's like to make it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Cooking and baking are the greatest pick-me-ups for loads of people, and you'd be hard-pressed to tear them from it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I get to make carrot pie with Savage..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mmhm, I want to make some!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Alright, then, let's make some together."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "The Doctor mentioned loving it too when we tried some together, so let's make a pie for when the Doctor comes back, and all three of us can enjoy it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That's wonderful..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Good! We're settled, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Follow me, Amiya. The carrots I asked from a work friend are in the kitchen freezer, plus we've got cheese, and the fowl eggs should be in..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
