    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Miss Savage, I cracked the fowl eggs!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "That quick? Lemme see..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Er."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "(How'd half the egg whites go missing...? And all the shells are broken in there, too...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Um, not... not too shabby. Let me just process it a bit more, and we can put them right in..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "D\u2014Did I do bad...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Wh-What do you mean? Haha. This is your first time cooking, Amiya. You're just not that used to it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Right, Amiya, could you wash the carrots for me? Mm-hm, the ones right there in the basket..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Aaah, you don't need to wash that many! Good, just like that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Hold on, you don't need your fingernails for carrots, you can just use a vegetable peeler... it's normal for them to be all bumpy. First time, after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "It's a bit hard, kneading dough. Just leave that to me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "No, let me set the oven, yeah? That's a little much to ask for now..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Wait, Amiya, that's not how you clean up flour\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
