    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Phew. Not too bad, and not a moment to lose."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Look, three pies, baked in the nick of time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mmhm, they smell so good..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Now we just need to sprinkle a little sugar on top and keep them warm, and that's a job very well done for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Come to mention it... I remember the Doctor was fond of particular tastes when it came to food. Amiya, do you have any idea?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mmhm! I remember all the things the Doctor likes about food. And... I remember about all the food you like too, Savage."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "What's this, what's this? You've been remembering things about me this whole time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Hehe... because you've been so nice looking after me, and when I see you eating something you really like, I get really happy too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I want to remember about everything that makes you happy!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "And also, I want to keep making all kinds of really nice food with you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "So, it... it'd be nice if we could stay together forever... just like the Doctor, I hope I can have fun with Savage forever..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "B-But, if you have work to do, then you should do it! I know work is very important..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "I'll be with you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Really?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Really. It's okay, Amiya, we're already super, super good friends."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Cautus sisters should love each other and live together, helping each all the way. So..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But... Dr. Kal'tsit said, before long, Babel and Rim Billiton PLC are going to finish their cooperative project, and then Savage would..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "You already know, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Yes, it's true. After that, I'll probably be heading back to work in Rim Billiton for a while."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "I'm already an adult, so there are responsibilities I have to bear. Right now, Rim Billiton still has some things I need to finish."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "But I'll come back to see you as soon as possible, Amiya. No matter how far apart we are, we're friends. So long as you need me to help, your big sis Savage'll come protect you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mmhm... I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Right. Right, then, let's drop this subject. Who knows if Rim Billiton'll forget about me, and they won't call me back in, and I'll be stuck as an unemployed drifter..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Maybe, if you keep at your studies, Amiya, you'll be like a VIP in future, and you'll start your own big company, and then I'll be one of your employees, yeah?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Whuh? My own company...? Um, could I do that...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Start putting in the effort now, and you'll get the chance one day, guaranteed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "The Doctor, Kal'tsit, Theresa, they're all especially mighty people. Make sure you learn well from your teachers, Amiya."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mmhm, I know. You're very mighty too, Savage. When you were in Rim Billiton\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "No way, no way, I can't compare to those bunch..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_051"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You're a super mighty teacher to me, Savage! You can make really nice food for me, you do work really well, and you've told me so many stories from Rim Billiton..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Also, I know, you like keeping me company... you look after me just like a real big sister would."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I know it'll be very scary when you leave... but, cooking today made me really happy. Thanks to this memory, I won't be so scared in the future."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_230_savage_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Same for me, Amiya. Coming to Babel, getting to see you all happy finding me for a chat, playing together, cooking... I've been so glad all this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "So, knowing we're about to part, I'm gonna be very sad too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "But, I won't ever let you look at me and worry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Amiya, living upon this vast world, each of us has things we need to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "You'll find your own direction, your own forward in the future, I promise. If we have the same beliefs... we'll definitely see each other again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "I'll strive to move forward. Amiya, you too..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Savage",
        "text": "Grow up safe and sound."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
