    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "A normal, unremarkable day."
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya has sought you out surprisingly early, bringing up the Rim Billiton delicacies coming this noon with expectation in her voice."
    },
    {
        "text": "Obviously, after the privilege of five healthy meals in a row, it's a very hard invitation to resist."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I've been looking forward to this 'banquet' for forever. Savage will meet almost any request I have, but it's cooking alone where she won't budge an inch."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "No formal invitations until all the ingredients were completely ready. Not the slightest thing could be lacking."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Savage is especially considerate of you.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Hehe... she's always had me act like such a spoiled child towards her. Besides, Savage makes such tasty food."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Oh, its taste might be on the tame side for some Operators, but it suits my palate very well. How do I put it? It has a flavor that brings back memories of the home you came from..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Ah, but I'm sure you'll like it too, Doctor. After all..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Something up?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Not really! I just wanted to share this with you... Savage welcomes you as a special guest, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We've been friends with Savage since long, long ago, so I know the food she makes is going to be delicious!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You say 'we'... Savage said she remembered me, but couldn't say much more.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It's true, she knew you then, and made you Rim Billiton delicacies many times before, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "How does she... perceive me?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "No need to worry, Doctor. To me and Savage both, you're someone utterly dependable, and worthy of trust."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I expect she's looking forward to this meal as a gift for you too, Doctor, for meeting once again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "She isn't just adept at food preparation, she's also very exact with raw ingredients too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Hmm... but I have no idea why tinned carrots from Rim Billiton were so hard to buy this year. They were the most important ingredient..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It wasn't just rising prices. Procurement channels have dropped off, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "For Rim Billitonians, carrots are essentially a most beloved food, and demand far outstrips supply for them on the market. They get even scarcer when you want to order goods you can send to Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Of course, more places besides Rim Billiton grow carrots. There'll be all sorts of different varieties in places all unalike. But Savage said..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "'If it's not Rim Billiton's sweet, crisp kind, it's not gonna do, Amiya. I'll have you tasting the delicacy from your memories, just you wait!'"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Hearing that's making me drool, too.;Carrots have their own fierce pride, too.",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Haha... I'm looking forward to it, Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Savage and I haven't seen each other in so long."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But the fact she's still willing to treat me like she did in the past, that... really reassures me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "...Sit yourself... down!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Eep!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That voice came from the dining hall... did something happen to Savage in there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
